# Phase 1 daily-screen report artifacts — ignored as a class, EXCEPT the
# backtest/ directory: those artifacts are the frozen reference numbers every
# pre-registered verdict points at (a bar, an SE, a detection floor), so they
# must survive this disk. `*` (not `reports/`) is deliberate — a negated path
# cannot be re-included while a parent directory is excluded.
apps/api/reports/*
!apps/api/reports/backtest/
__pycache__/

# Python (Futu OpenAPI SDK)
.venv/

# Local SQLite backups
apps/api/prisma/dev.db.bak-*
